/**
 * ScoutForge sourcing vocabulary (editorial, hand-curated, versioned).
 *
 * Each skill has:
 *  - detect: phrases that count as evidence when they appear verbatim in a job
 *    description (matched case-insensitively on word boundaries, so "SQL" never
 *    matches "NoSQL"). `exact` lists short acronyms that must match case-sensitively.
 *  - search: the terms a sourcer actually types, per profile language. German and
 *    Polish terms are editorial translations of common profile wording, not ESCO data.
 *
 * Nothing here is generated by a model or claims market facts.
 */
